			<div class="content" id="post-content-642696">
									

<p>glad this is so well received! wrote this on a whim, and was hoping to catch a kind of hallucinogenic feel to this. 455 is a horrible, horrible nightmare, so people stuck in it very quickly lose their anchor with reality. I see some guy in a office, receiving this for review. He listens, and for several seconds afterward, he just sits there, eyes wide, just trying to process.</p>
